@spec editor_new_modal_spec  src=tests/specs/editor_new_modal_spec.lua  loc=110  cases=5
@harness   mk

# Intent
  The swing and temper editors' New modal, drawn over a fake imgui: does the Create button
  see the name standing in the field? ReaImGui hands a buffer back only on a frame the call
  returns true, so a field flagged EnterReturnsTrue reads blank to every gesture but Enter.
  Fake-imgui recipe from temperEditor_tree_spec.

# Helpers
  @fn mkEditors(harness)  @ 45-59
      -- Both editors, over one harness, returning the modal bodies they registered.
  @fn create(harness, kind, text, gesture)  @ 62-67
      -- One frame of a New modal, with the field holding `text` and `gesture` confirming it.

# Cases
  @case 'the Create button names the new swing from the field'  [harness]  @ 71-75
  @case 'Enter in the field names it too'  [harness]  @ 79-83
  @case 'the Create button names the new temper from the field'  [harness]  @ 87-91
  @case 'Enter in the field names the temper too'  [harness]  @ 95-99
  @case 'an empty field asks for a name rather than closing'  [harness]  @ 103-108

